{"seq":45,"at":"2026-10-22","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2276"},"reason":"The Großstadtrevier episode „Foul“ (no. 367), in which Olivia Jones appears as herself (credited as barmaid Olivia), was first shown on 2 February 2015, not in 2014; the bodies now say so. Notes record that the TP card's claim of a 2014 corpse role in „Morden im Norden“ is found in no episode list or filmography.","by":"handcheck-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.fernsehserien.de/grossstadtrevier/folgen/foul-680375"},{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gro%C3%9Fstadtrevier/Episodenliste"},{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olivia_Jones"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",244],["-","2014 "],["=",4],["-","„Foul“"],["+","„Foul“,"],["=",1],["+","first shown in February 2015, "],["=",24],["-","herself."],["+","herself"],["=",1],["+","as the barmaid Olivia. "],["=",433]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",220],["-","„Foul“"],["+","„Foul“,"],["=",1],["-","von"],["+","erstmals"],["=",1],["-","2014"],["+","ausgestrahlt"],["=",1],["+","im Februar 2015, "],["=",24],["-","selbst."],["+","selbst"],["=",1],["+","– als Thekenfrau Olivia. "],["=",411]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",246],["-","«Foul»"],["+","«Foul»,"],["=",1],["-","2014"],["+","впервые"],["=",1],["-","года"],["+","показанной"],["=",1],["+","в феврале 2015 года, "],["=",18],["-","себя."],["+","себя"],["=",1],["+","— барменшу Оливию. "],["=",411]]},{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",19],["+"," Olivia Jones: the card claims a 2014 guest role as a corpse in „Morden im Norden“; no episode list or filmography records one – her documented crime-series appearance is in Großstadtrevier („Foul“, first shown on 2 February 2015)."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",19],["+"," Olivia Jones: Die Karte behauptet einen Gastauftritt als Leiche in „Morden im Norden“ 2014; keine Episodenliste und keine Filmografie verzeichnet einen solchen – belegt ist ihr Krimiauftritt im „Großstadtrevier“ („Foul“, Erstausstrahlung am 2. Februar 2015)."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["=",15],["+"," Оливия Джонс: карточка утверждает, что в 2014 году она сыграла труп в сериале «Morden im Norden»; ни один список серий и ни одна фильмография этого не подтверждают — документально подтверждено её появление в «Großstadtrevier» (серия «Foul», премьера 2 февраля 2015 года)."]]}],"hash":"7440c5de09af"},
